  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Fur Reality was a furry convention in Cincinnati, Ohio, started by the Ringtail Cafe studio in 2013 and run by Ringtail Cafe Productions. It was described as an \"immersive\" convention, with an in-con storyline and games and a convention area decorated to draw attendees into the world of each year's theme. It supported the Ohio Alleycat Resource, a non-profit offering spay and neuter services and a no-kill adoption center. Seven editions were held, from 2013 to 2019, with attendance growing from 160 to 576.",
